{
  "sn12.10:0.1": "Linked Discourses 12.10 ",
  "sn12.10:0.2": "1. The Buddhas ",
  "sn12.10:0.3": "Gotama ",
  "sn12.10:1.1": "“Mendicants, before my awakening—when I was still unawakened but intent on awakening—I thought: ",
  "sn12.10:1.2": "‘Alas, this world has fallen into trouble. It’s born, grows old, dies, passes away, and is reborn, ",
  "sn12.10:1.3": "yet it doesn’t understand how to escape from this suffering, from old age and death. ",
  "sn12.10:1.4": "Oh, when will an escape be found from this suffering, from old age and death?’ ",
  "sn12.10:2.1": "Then it occurred to me: ",
  "sn12.10:2.2": "‘When what exists is there old age and death? What is a requirement for old age and death?’ ",
  "sn12.10:2.3": "Then, through rational application of mind, I penetrated with wisdom: ",
  "sn12.10:2.4": "‘When rebirth exists there’s old age and death. Rebirth is a requirement for old age and death.’ ",
  "sn12.10:3.1": "Then it occurred to me: ",
  "sn12.10:3.2": "‘When what exists is there rebirth? … ",
  "sn12.10:3.3": "continued existence … ",
  "sn12.10:3.4": "grasping … ",
  "sn12.10:3.5": "craving … ",
  "sn12.10:3.6": "feeling … ",
  "sn12.10:3.7": "contact … ",
  "sn12.10:3.8": "the six sense fields … ",
  "sn12.10:3.9": "name and form … ",
  "sn12.10:3.10": "consciousness … ",
  "sn12.10:3.11": "‘When what exists are there choices? What is a requirement for choices?’ ",
  "sn12.10:3.12": "Then, through rational application of mind, I penetrated with 